{
    "title": "Project Match: ASMR Salon",
    "description": "The game you are currently watching is a diverse game that integrates 3D match, beauty makeup, ASMR treatment, and home decoration. \r\n\r\nHere, not only can you play a relaxing 3D elimination game, but you can also earn gold coins through the game to give yourself a beautiful makeup. What type of makeup do I put on today, American retro makeup or Korean nude look? Next, pair your makeup with a suitable set of clothing, with a variety of styles to choose from. What's more, the game also includes stress relieving ASMR treatment levels, where there are too many black heads on her nose, helping her squeeze them out; The acne is about to explode, help her squeeze out the pus; Her finger was scratched, help her bandage the wound; There are more other projects waiting for you to explore!\r\n\r\nHow to play?\r\n-Confirm the target item and quantity in the task;\r\n-Click to pair three identical items to eliminate them;\r\n-When encountering difficulties, multiple props can be used;\r\n-Obtain gold coin rewards through levels;\r\n-Start makeup, dressing, renovation, and ASMR treatment.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- There are a large number of vivid 3D elimination objects and high-quality art resources, giving everyone a refreshing feeling.\r\n- The difficulty of the levels is evenly distributed, with both challenging and easy levels, so you won\u2019t feel bored or stressed.\r\n- Regularly updated, various innovative activities will be launched to win more rewards and ensure that everyone does not lack game content.\r\n- Players who like beauty makeup and outfits can showcase their skills in the game and freely choose their own favorite combinations and makeup creations.\r\n- You can create your own room and residence in the style you like, with various decoration styles for you to choose from.\r\n- Rich plot allows you to be immersed in the scene and as if you are experiencing the protagonist's life.\r\n- Hands-on operation for the protagonist in the game to treat injuries, do beauty projects, and learn a lot about the treatment process.\r\n- Fulfill your wishes that you want to do but can't do in real life!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The game you are currently watching is a diverse game that integrates 3D match, beauty makeup, ASMR treatment, and home decoration. <br><br>Here, not only can you play a relaxing 3D elimination game, but you can also earn gold coins through the game to give yourself a beautiful makeup. What type of makeup do I put on today, American retro makeup or Korean nude look? Next, pair your makeup with a suitable set of clothing, with a variety of styles to choose from. What&#39;s more, the game also includes stress relieving ASMR treatment levels, where there are too many black heads on her nose, helping her squeeze them out; The acne is about to explode, help her squeeze out the pus; Her finger was scratched, help her bandage the wound; There are more other projects waiting for you to explore!<br><br>How to play?<br>-Confirm the target item and quantity in the task;<br>-Click to pair three identical items to eliminate them;<br>-When encountering difficulties, multiple props can be used;<br>-Obtain gold coin rewards through levels;<br>-Start makeup, dressing, renovation, and ASMR treatment.<br><br>Game features:<br>- There are a large number of vivid 3D elimination objects and high-quality art resources, giving everyone a refreshing feeling.<br>- The difficulty of the levels is evenly distributed, with both challenging and easy levels, so you won\u2019t feel bored or stressed.<br>- Regularly updated, various innovative activities will be launched to win more rewards and ensure that everyone does not lack game content.<br>- Players who like beauty makeup and outfits can showcase their skills in the game and freely choose their own favorite combinations and makeup creations.<br>- You can create your own room and residence in the style you like, with various decoration styles for you to choose from.<br>- Rich plot allows you to be immersed in the scene and as if you are experiencing the protagonist&#39;s life.<br>- Hands-on operation for the protagonist in the game to treat injuries, do beauty projects, and learn a lot about the treatment process.<br>- Fulfill your wishes that you want to do but can&#39;t do in real life!",
    "summary": "Play Project Match, apply beautiful makeup, and live in dream home you created!",
